  "details": "I've been making avatars for 4ish years now, and a lot of my avatars require cutout shaders; it really pains me how much I have to compromise for Quest users only for it to look worse. It would really be lovely if there was some way to get cutout/alpha transparency on Quest; I'm sure the hardware is better and could handle it better than before.",
